{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"db127a4111d2403b0b15535c4347c126b0a289d15aa4716cfcb7b88da9817d87","ja":"ヒマな時間のつぶし方","zh":"打发空闲时间的方法","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"017f6f82baac8a549cdf073495b6c52c6fb10a6076c32af6d059d183394e91df","ja":"今日はフェスのお仕事。みんなは楽屋になっている\nテントの中でヒマを持て余していて……","zh":"今天是有音乐节的工作。大家在充当休息室的\n帐篷里闲得发慌，于是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9492f57e4a93e6f8732aaa66cd4b1d465bdc91637cb5fa8682b409687260ca5f","ja":"亜美たちの出番まだ～？\nもう待ちくたびれちったよ～！","zh":"还没轮到亚美我们出场吗～？\n都快等得不耐烦啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"62fba62a3eb767f5898d48eb7153ec01b9874b80b12b4bce94d88c247ae6d5d8","ja":"仕方ないぞ！　前のお仕事が急に中止になって、\nそのまま来ちゃったんだからね！","zh":"这也是没办法的嘛！之前的工作突然被取消了，\n我就直接过来了呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d4b91d02289f588ed9edcc228cdad279b1ad017ab6eb33ada098192ba72a6b60","ja":"でもじーっと待ってるの飽きたよ～。\nいおり～ん、なんか面白いことない～？","zh":"不过一直傻等着我都腻了～。\n伊织～，有没有什么好玩的事呀～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e9f55a58521e1b299663009bfb4073d064d474bc7515cd21b05df1141cd618d1","ja":"面白いことねぇ……そういえば、世界的に有名な\n海外の歌手が、近くの楽屋にいるみたいよ。","zh":"有趣的事啊……这么说来，附近的一间休息室里\n好像有一位世界知名的外国歌手呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"eccfaee27942c91d2b018bedf36d8f3760fd8a285c234ae17a2f4e8eaea5931e","ja":"そうなんだ？　出演するのは知ってたから、\nちょっと気になってたんだけど。","zh":"这样啊？因为我知道你要出演，\n所以还挺在意的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3ce09ce32fcd019102e114270bb7869ddb99efcb800de72f28eaf21be525509c","ja":"でも、ここに来るまでに\nお見かけしませんでしたね。","zh":"不过，在来这里的路上\n好像没有看到您呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"66edac8c3ad2365852269e0465d0e72c1696bfd517ef553d86b88054cea8e485","ja":"んっふっふ～、ふたりとも気になるみたいだね～？\nんじゃあ、楽屋挨拶に行ってみる？","zh":"唔呼呼～，你们两个好像都很在意呢～？\n那么，要去后台打个招呼看看吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"1b3dccd0ca73c7c5c463b16df0a23b7e8383b09c186d85d1671d2794117756dd","ja":"いいの！？　海外の大物アーティストって、\n警備とかすごいって思ってたんだけど？","zh":"可以吗！？我本来还以为\n海外大牌艺人的安保会特别森严呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c6ee373bf2d9d90911c455b6f171f25773bb841513b46519947213dede3c98a4","ja":"アイドルはアピールしないとだよ！　兄ちゃんも\nよく顔はメイシンって言ってるし、挨拶は大事っしょ！","zh":"偶像就得多多宣传自己才行！哥哥也\n常说什么看脸的名信片，问候很重要对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"180b82a59b610c6cbcc37c68d65e7c0919ed9800799600e486c4df423cfc4f5d","ja":"それを言うなら、迷信じゃなくって名刺でしょ！","zh":"那应该叫名片，不叫迷信吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"1898355cf43eff08c1fb11298deefde17964bab1f43f32e465cee3262037c257","ja":"それに挨拶って、亜美が暇つぶししたいだけじゃない。\n出番まで大人しく待ってた方がいいと思うわよ。","zh":"而且说什么去打招呼，其实只是亚美自己想打发时间吧。\n我觉得在上场之前还是老老实实待着比较好哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"a1a863c21a6386b0e22d62ea166bd7684e0d9c5c0f906642ead020f02d32789a","ja":"でも出番まではまだまだ時間あるよね……。自分も\n待ちくたびれたし、その歌手に会ってみたいぞ！","zh":"不过离登场还有不少时间呢……。我也\n等得有些累了，想去见见那位歌手！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"738a1e3ed6617da4427481613edae0b3e637681580adf399e1af27c323d1bd95","ja":"さっすがひびきん！　さあ、いおりんはどうする？\nこのままだといおりんだけ、お留守番になっちゃうよ？","zh":"真不愧是响！那么，伊织要怎么办呢？\n再这样下去，可就只有伊织要留下来看家了哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1281.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"f548103d7fe34fdd0674dbabb9a46366f51b53bbe413b4e4571ae2c37460db24","ja":"わ、私だけって……！？\n分かったわよ！　そんなに言うなら私も行くわ！","zh":"就、就我一个人……！？\n我知道了啦！既然你都说到这份上了，那我也去！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
